      "query_image_sha256": null
    },
    {
      "task_id": "feature_05",
      "instruction": "OTIS SPUNKMEYER IS THE NAME FOR BAKED GOODS: Dedicated to baking, experimenting, and creating delicious treats for over 40 years. Always committed to use fewer ingredients and none of the funky stuff.",
      "query_mode": "text",
      "query_image": null,
      "query_image_sha256": null
    },
    {
      "task_id": "feature_06",
      "instruction": "GLUTEN FREE COOKIES: Chocolate chunk cookies are certified gluten free with no bleached flour, artificial flavors or preservatives; Non-dairy recipe",
      "query_mode": "text",
      "query_image": null,
      "query_image_sha256": null
    },
    {
      "task_id": "feature_07",
      "instruction": "Makes about 36 Nestle Toll House cookies packed with semi sweet chocolate morsels",
      "query_mode": "text",
      "query_image": null,
      "query_image_sha256": null
    },
    {
      "task_id": "feature_08",
      "instruction": "EASY PREPARATION: Bake - Preheat oven for 10 minutes. Place a pan liner on a baking pan. Place cookies 2\" apart on a parchment paper pan liner. Make sure that the oven thermostat is accurate. Baking time will vary by type of oven and number of racked used at one time. When properly baked, cookies will remain soft even after cooling. Allow cookies to cool for 30 minutes before removing them from the baking pan. Cookies are still baking while chilling on the pan.",
      "query_mode": "text",
      "query_image": null,
      "query_image_sha256": null
    },
    {
      "task_id": "feature_09",
      "instruction": "For game nights, school events and, of course, the holiday season, Pillsbury Ready To Bake Sugar Cookies are ready to make your day.",
      "query_mode": "text",
